1
00:00:04,049 --> 00:00:05,879
I threw a stool at my landlord.

2
00:00:05,879 --> 00:00:06,419
I'm Mara.

3
00:00:06,419 --> 00:00:10,089
He stole the fuse that keeps my
cat alive, and I want it back.

4
00:00:10,849 --> 00:00:13,049
He put my best
friend in his pocket.

5
00:00:13,149 --> 00:00:15,069
It's only a fuse, Miss Reyes.

6
00:00:15,069 --> 00:00:16,899
You'll hardly miss him.

7
00:00:16,949 --> 00:00:18,209
Give him back.

8
00:00:18,309 --> 00:00:19,249
No.

9
00:00:19,539 --> 00:00:21,749
So I threw a stool
at my landlord.

10
00:00:22,559 --> 00:00:25,119
That is coming out
of your deposit.

11
00:00:25,419 --> 00:00:27,419
Then the other me lit one word.

12
00:00:27,419 --> 00:00:27,919
Go.

13
00:00:28,419 --> 00:00:28,849
He ran.

14
00:00:28,849 --> 00:00:30,439
Past a hundred dead signs.

15
00:00:30,439 --> 00:00:32,759
And every one of
them was a name.

16
00:00:33,359 --> 00:00:36,709
Careful! Break the ring,
and they all go out.

17
00:00:36,909 --> 00:00:38,779
I only wanted the green one.

18
00:00:39,779 --> 00:00:41,899
Cautious! I was going
to say cautious.

19
00:00:41,989 --> 00:00:43,819
Don't you ever do that again.

20
00:00:44,029 --> 00:00:45,839
Wait. You threw a stool? For me?

21
00:00:46,439 --> 00:00:48,979
And then I saw the
tag on the next fuse.

22
00:00:49,969 --> 00:00:51,419
Mara? That's your mom.

23
00:00:52,219 --> 00:00:54,489
Nine years. And
it was still warm.

24
00:00:56,099 --> 00:00:57,859
My mother is on a key ring.

25
00:00:58,059 --> 00:00:59,889
She came to me, you know.

26
00:00:59,889 --> 00:01:01,279
Nine years ago.

27
00:01:01,329 --> 00:01:02,469
You're lying.

28
00:01:02,569 --> 00:01:04,379
I came for you, Miss Reyes.

29
00:01:04,379 --> 00:01:06,669
You were fifteen,
and fast asleep.

30
00:01:06,669 --> 00:01:08,509
She offered me a trade.

31
00:01:09,109 --> 00:01:10,469
So she hung up her coat.

32
00:01:10,469 --> 00:01:11,429
She lit one word.

33
00:01:11,429 --> 00:01:15,139
And she walked out into the
rain, so he would never come in.

34
00:01:15,739 --> 00:01:15,999
Mara.

35
00:01:15,999 --> 00:01:16,459
The sign.

36
00:01:16,459 --> 00:01:18,299
It wasn't telling you to wait.

37
00:01:18,599 --> 00:01:19,799
She was telling him.

38
00:01:20,799 --> 00:01:23,109
All these years, I
thought she left me.

39
00:01:23,609 --> 00:01:26,539
I also died today, and
nobody has said sorry.

40
00:01:26,489 --> 00:01:27,699
Sorry, Zip.

41
00:01:27,599 --> 00:01:29,009
Thank you. Continue.

42
00:01:29,519 --> 00:01:31,289
Trade me. Let her go.

43
00:01:31,589 --> 00:01:32,139
Gladly.

44
00:01:32,139 --> 00:01:34,889
Be inside number
nine, at midnight.

45
00:01:34,889 --> 00:01:35,659
Alone.

46
00:01:35,859 --> 00:01:36,839
She's never alone.

47
00:01:36,839 --> 00:01:38,059
I'm rechargeable.

48
00:01:38,359 --> 00:01:40,509
You have until midnight.

49
00:01:41,409 --> 00:01:42,979
It was already eleven.

50
00:01:44,483 --> 00:01:47,183
Every sign on this
street was once a person.

51
00:01:47,283 --> 00:01:47,713
Even me.

52
00:01:47,713 --> 00:01:49,813
I was a bouncer,
forty years ago.

53
00:01:49,763 --> 00:01:51,033
You? You're a cat.

54
00:01:50,973 --> 00:01:52,243
The club was called the Cat.

55
00:01:52,243 --> 00:01:53,223
I have no luck.

56
00:01:53,623 --> 00:01:54,843
Fifty minutes left.

57
00:01:54,843 --> 00:01:56,873
So I knocked on every name.

58
00:01:57,073 --> 00:01:57,923
Ruth says run.

59
00:01:57,923 --> 00:01:58,823
Otis says hide.

60
00:01:58,823 --> 00:02:00,943
Pete says he left the oven on.

61
00:02:01,233 --> 00:02:02,523
And what do you say?

62
00:02:02,533 --> 00:02:03,993
I say, ask for help.

63
00:02:04,033 --> 00:02:05,303
I don't do that.

64
00:02:05,313 --> 00:02:07,263
I know. Nine years,
and not once.

65
00:02:07,963 --> 00:02:11,493
Then, at the end of the row,
I found a board with no name.

66
00:02:11,883 --> 00:02:13,463
Mara. It's already wired.

67
00:02:13,763 --> 00:02:15,823
And it was exactly my size.

68
00:02:16,023 --> 00:02:17,893
It's warming up.
It's warming up!

69
00:02:17,993 --> 00:02:19,453
We ran for the door.

70
00:02:19,653 --> 00:02:21,363
She was standing in front of it.

71
00:02:21,363 --> 00:02:22,353
The other me.

72
00:02:22,653 --> 00:02:23,983
Please. Move.

73
00:02:24,393 --> 00:02:25,853
Mara, she has the key.

74
00:02:25,953 --> 00:02:27,293
She looked me in the eye.

75
00:02:27,293 --> 00:02:28,723
And she locked us in.
